@startuml
title CorDapp Lifecycle
' !include https://raw.githubusercontent.com/plantuml-stdlib/C4-PlantUML/master/C4_Container.puml

actor "Application Publisher/\nLibrary Developer" as APP_PUB order 10 #LightGreen 
actor "System/Infra\n Operator" as INFRA_OP order 20 #LightGreen 
actor "Network\n Operator" as NET_OP order 30 #LightGreen 
actor "CorDapp\n User" as CORDAPP_USER order 35 #LightPink
actor "VNode\n Operator" as VNODE_OP order 40 #LightPink 
actor "Cluster\n Operator" as CLUSTER_OP order 50 #LightYellow 

participant "\nMGM\n Cluster\n" as MGM order 70 #LightGreen 
participant "\nMember\n Cluster\n" as MEMBER order 70 #LightCoral 
participant "\nNotary\n Cluster\n" as NOTARY order 80 #LightGreen
participant "\nPeer\n Cluster\n" as PEER order 90 #red
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center


hide footbox
' hide unlinked
|||
hnote over APP_PUB  #LightGray: \n<size:17> **Develop CorDapp** </size> \n
hnote over INFRA_OP, MGM  #LightGray: \n<size:17> ** MGM Cluster Installation and Configuration ** </size> \n
hnote over NET_OP, MGM  #LightGray: \n<size:17> **MGM Onboarding** </size> \n
hnote over APP_PUB, MGM  #LightGray: \n<size:17> **CPI creation and signing** </size> \n
hnote over INFRA_OP, MEMBER  #LightGray: \n<size:17> **Member cluster Installation and Configuration** </size> \n
hnote over NET_OP, MEMBER  #LightGray: \n<size:17> **Member Onboarding** </size> \n
hnote over MGM, MEMBER  #LightGray: \n<size:17> **Participants list distribution ** </size> \n
hnote over CORDAPP_USER, PEER  #LightGray: \n<size:17> **CorDapp Flow execution** </size> \n
hnote over APP_PUB, MEMBER  #LightGray: \n<size:17> **CorDapp/CPI Upgrade** </size> \n

@enduml